OL,3,AU2 celebrate 50th anniversary at the
OL,4,Aschool where they formed
OL,5,
OL,6,FExactly 50 years after they formed, U2
OL,7,Freturned to Dublin to play a gig at the
OL,8,Fschool where they met.
OL,10,F"We've escaped from the lab," declared
OL,11,FBono, as they quartet took to a stage
OL,12,Fin the playground. "How's the
OL,13,Fexperiment working for you?"
OL,15,FThe pupils of Mount Temple
OL,16,FComprehensive may not have been born
OL,17,Fwhen U2 were the world's biggest band,
OL,18,Fbut they gave them a hero's welcome,
OL,19,Fwaving signs that said, "I love U2",
OL,20,F"It's a beautiful day - no school",
OL,21,Fand, "Bono, my mum says hi!"
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
