OL,3,AU2 celebrate 50th anniversary at the
OL,4,Aschool where they formed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group treated them to a
OL,7,Fcareer-spanning set that included hits
OL,8,Flike I Will Follow, Vertigo and With Or
OL,9,FWithout You, as well as their latest
OL,10,Fsingle, Silencio.
